'''Grey Lake''' is a glacially fed lake in [[Torres del Paine National Park]], southern [[Chile]].
[[File:The southern Patagonian mountains are reflected on the calm surface waters of Grey Lake.jpg|thumb|The southern Patagonian mountains are reflected on the calm surface waters of Grey Lake.]]
